OL,3,GNEWSA'Visible security presence' for
OL,4,Astate visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be a "visible and enhanced
OL,7,Fpolice and security presence" in
OL,8,FWindsor next week for the state visit
OL,9,Fof the Sultan of Oman.
OL,11,FHis Majesty Sultan Haitham bin Tarik
OL,12,Fwill be hosted by King Charles and
OL,13,FQueen Camilla at Windsor Castle from 20
OL,14,FOctober until 22 October.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police's (TVP) Ch Supt
OL,17,FAdrian Hall said airspace restrictions
OL,18,Fare part of the "robust security
OL,19,Foperation" that has been put in place.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
