OL,3,GNEWSA'Visible security presence' for
OL,4,Astate visit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As a force, we have a vast amount of
OL,7,Fexperience in policing Royal events in
OL,8,FWindsor and significant planning and
OL,9,Fpreparation has gone into this event,"
OL,10,Fhe added.
